  "status": "Application Under Consideration",
  "description": "Erection of basement and erection of two storey rear extension at basement and lower ground floor levels to create additional floorspace for lower ground floor flat.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-ec27461c-7fff-6870-98b1-2bc209cdd80f&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of insufficient information fails to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in harm to trees on and off site. The application fails to submit an Arboricultural&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; Impact Assessment (AIA) and Arboricultural Method Statement (AMS) in line with BS5837 (2012) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;addressing the council’s concerns that the proposal could result in harm to the trees through root disturbance. The proposal is therefore contrary to policy LP51 of the Hackney Local Plan (LP33) and policy G7 of the London Plan (2021).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
